anything on Astral will try to steal it from you... Someone else might
correct me, though I dug around in spoilers for a bit to check. 

The other advice given in this post and others, of course, is excellent,
and I've learned a couple of things for my next run. The "give up on the
amulet of lifesaving" advice might be excellent too, I just disagree. :)

